title: "Speech-Act Contracts & SpeakFix"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark, rule-based SpeakFix mitigation pipeline, and evaluation, baseline,
  and human-study scripts for measuring and repairing speech-act contract
  violations (uptake failures and void commitments) in large language models.
